# Everything an update-channel compromise would have to go through.
#
# Talkify is unsandboxed by necessity (a CGEvent tap and the Accessibility
# APIs), so Sparkle is the one remote-influenced path into a fully privileged
# process. These paths decide which signing key is trusted, what the feed
# says, and what the release script does with both. A change to any of them
# should be looked at by a human who is not the one proposing it.

/Talkify/Info.plist       @tornikegomareli
/appcast.xml              @tornikegomareli
/scripts/                 @tornikegomareli
/Casks/                   @tornikegomareli
/.github/                 @tornikegomareli
